msgid "Costmodel 端到端示例"
msgstr "End-to-End Example of Cost Model"

msgid "本示例展示 costmodel 后端的基本调用流程："
msgstr "This example demonstrates the basic calling flow of the costmodel backend."

msgid "使用 Triton 前端算子生成 TTIR；"
msgstr "Use the Triton frontend operator to generate TTIR."

msgid "为多个候选 config 构造 `costmodel_bench` item；"
msgstr "Construct `costmodel_bench` items for multiple candidate configurations;"

msgid "对每个 item 调用一次 `costmodel_bench`，并汇总每个 config 的预测耗时。"
msgstr "Call `costmodel_bench` once for each item, and aggregate the predicted latency of each config."

msgid "这个流程适合在 autotune 前快速筛掉预计性能较差的 config。示例只使用向量加法 kernel，便于聚焦 costmodel 的输入和返回值。"
msgstr "You can use this process to quickly filter out configurations with poor estimated performance before autotune. The sample uses only the vector addition kernel to help you focus on the inputs and return values of the costmodel."

msgid "完整示例"
msgstr "Complete example"

msgid "将下面的代码保存为 `costmodel_example.py` 后运行："
msgstr "Save the following code as `costmodel_example.py` and run it:"

msgid "TTIR 示例"
msgstr "TTIR example"

msgid "调用 `make_ttir` 生成的 TTIR 示例（截取关键部分）："
msgstr "TTIR example generated by calling `make_ttir` (key parts excerpted):"

msgid "输出结果"
msgstr "Output results"

msgid "不同版本的 costmodel 参数可能会使具体数值略有不同，但输出结构类似："
msgstr "Cost model parameters in different versions may cause slight variations in specific values, but the output structure is similar:"

msgid "`costmodel_bench` 每次评估一个 item，返回 `(config, latency_us)`。上层 autotune 逻辑可以逐个调用并汇总成字典，再按预测耗时排序，优先保留预测更快的 config。"
msgstr "`costmodel_bench` evaluates one item at a time and returns `(config, latency_us)`. The upper-layer autotune logic can call them one by one and aggregate the results into a dictionary. Then, it sorts the results by predicted latency and prioritizes keeping the faster predicted configs."

msgid "关键点说明"
msgstr "Key Points Explanation"

msgid "`ASTSource + ast_to_ttir` 只生成 TTIR，不会真实编译或启动 kernel。"
msgstr "`ASTSource + ast_to_ttir` only generates TTIR and does not actually compile or launch the kernel."

msgid "`config` 会影响 `tl.constexpr`，例如 `BLOCK_SIZE`，因此每个候选 config 都需要生成各自的 TTIR。"
msgstr "`config` affects `tl.constexpr`, for example, `BLOCK_SIZE`. Therefore, each candidate configuration must generate its own TTIR."

msgid "`costmodel_bench` 每次只接收一个 item。该 item 至少包含 `config` 和 `ttir`，也可以附带 `arg_bindings`。"
msgstr "`costmodel_bench` receives only one item at a time. The item contains at least `config` and `ttir`, and can also include `arg_bindings`."

msgid "`arg_bindings` 用于把运行时整数参数绑定到 TTIR 中的 `%argN`。例如本例中 `n_elements=98432` 对应 `arg3=98432`。"
msgstr "`arg_bindings` binds runtime integer arguments to `%argN` in TTIR. For example, in this case, `n_elements=98432` corresponds to `arg3=98432`."

msgid "如果 kernel 中使用 `tl.program_id(0)`，通常需要传入 `pid_x=0`。如果还使用 `tl.num_programs(0)`，可额外传入 `num_programs_x=...`。"
msgstr "If you use `tl.program_id(0)` in the kernel, you usually need to pass `pid_x=0`. If you also use `tl.num_programs(0)`, you can additionally pass `num_programs_x=...`."
